      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "beth-graves-demo"
        },
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#faf7f0;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:4.4cqw 7cqw 5cqw'><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e'>Profile</div><div style='font:700 5.8cqw/1.1 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#1f2937'>Beth Graves</div><div style='font:400 2.1cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:2cqw;max-width:60cqw'>Gaming, livestream and ASMR creator who goes by Machine Mommy online. Her site says she streams on Twitch, makes original YouTube series and ASMR, and has a community of over a million followers across platforms.</div><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2.4cqw;align-items:flex-end;margin-top:3cqw'><figure style='margin:0;width:24cqw'><img src='data:image/jpeg;base64,' alt='Photo from her Facebook page' style='display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%;border-radius:1cqw;border:.2cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.45)'/><figcaption style='margin-top:.8cqw;font:italic 1.3cqw/1.35 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#64748b'>Photo from her Facebook page</figcaption></figure></div><div style='margin-top:2.6cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>3 facts to check: Beth Graves, Machine_Mommy vlogs, X / Twitter</div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>Works</div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Twitch livestreams</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Live sessions on the channel machine_mommy, with a weekly stream schedule posted on her site.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Gaming channel</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Her YouTube channel for gaming videos and original series.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>ASMR channel</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Relaxing ASMR videos on YouTube (@RealMommyAsmr), meant to give her community a place to unwind.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Machine_Mommy vlogs<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Her YouTube vlog channel (@Machine_Mommy_vlogs). Only its name was confirmed; nothing about its content or start.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Instagram</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>instagram.com/Machine_Mommy, linked from her site.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>TikTok</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>tiktok.com/@machine_mommy, linked from her site.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Facebook</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>facebook.com/m0therofmachines, linked from her site.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Discord community</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>discord.gg/machinemommy, her community server, linked from her site.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>X / Twitter<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>x.com/machine_mommy, the account her site links. A second account, machinemommyTTV, exists but her site does not link it.</div></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail: the profile as one page, written from the cards. The Method writes it, so edit the cards and not this.",
